{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"c8f3de56fa8a92dc10ea68296b1550b6ac29ed84b88382434c0003b9ed095057","ja":"名探偵矢吹？","zh":"名侦探矢吹？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1795281a93b7e05983cb20dc147d892400ea38311b860a3a87fb8f7661dbf77c","ja":"子どもたちを引き連れて歩く麗花さんですか～。\nまるで『ハーメルンの笛吹き男』みたいですね～。","zh":"带着孩子们一起走的丽花小姐吗～\n简直就像《花衣魔笛手》一样呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2837081b714cb4319ed43f9e13163318a94a18b7970bbd69388a4d6df5653f75","ja":"あっ、本当にそうみたいでした！　麗花さんの後ろを、\n子どもたちが楽しそうについて行ってて……。","zh":"啊，看起来真的像那样呢！孩子们开开心心地\n跟在丽花小姐身后……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"fcdeacac99e77656c758906bc7f1ec579d06ad1a167dc3376cc8ad1f3ba3966f","ja":"「そして笛吹き男は子どもたちを街の外に連れていき、\nみんな二度と帰ってはきませんでした」","zh":"“于是吹笛人把孩子们带出了城镇，\n大家便再也没有回来”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"65260c92a115c3d1f8e97789a3f3cb99fab22836a7e809d74ea39ee88afe9065","ja":"ホラーみたいなお話ですよね……。\n麗花さんは、どうしてそんなこと……。","zh":"就像恐怖故事一样呢……\n丽花小姐，为什么要那样……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"415af556b58587387bb607588280bfaaeaea618d30fb1c4086b784eef0347227","ja":"さっき急いで帰ってったのも、そのためなのかな～？\n可奈ちゃん、何かわかったら教えてね♪","zh":"刚才走得那么急，也是因为这个原因吗～？\n可奈，要是知道什么了记得告诉我哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"6c36847b242b6774950cf74923f3632350a4115ea1d6a8e8750cbaeeaa73e9b0","ja":"名探偵矢吹君！　『ぷっぷかの笛吹き女』の\n正体を突き止めるため、頑張ってくれたまえ～！","zh":"名侦探矢吹君！为了查明“噗噗咔吹笛女”的\n真实身份，好好加油吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"a250095e61ca8e493d614a59ebecaebfec825e26726ce10f0bf9bbc6f35387a2","ja":"ええっ！？　ふたりは一緒に\n行ってくれないの～？　朋花さんは？","zh":"咦！？你们两个不一起\n去吗～？朋花小姐呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"02f96fae8638f9b1623bcd0505f006430a501c3cc1faf1237dd7676a485ce2ac","ja":"残念ですが、私たちはお仕事がありますので～。\n名探偵さんの活躍、期待していますよ～。","zh":"虽然很遗憾，但我们还有工作要做呢～。\n名侦探，我很期待你的活跃表现哦～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"d88da981df465b22918ab4b4cf1c14be510c16f498fcfa55b4986eadc4962f49","ja":"そ、そんな～！\n私だけで、謎がわかるかな……？","zh":"怎、怎么这样～！\n光凭我自己，能解开谜团吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"0ef7f673928b45f1c30c3e368beadc2dfcec4c2aed36c29d48bb836b4aa4d4cd","ja":"（謎をとくなら、まずは何をしてるか確かめないと\nだよね。見つからないように、そーっと……）","zh":"（要想解开谜团，首先得确认他们在做什么\n才行呢。为了不被发现，悄悄地……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"7d9d11f63b4a72e0b58a9d57e4e26e3ae06a01fa6f9fb0c71866fde128b1f9c3","ja":"楽しいこと～♪　みんなで見つけよう～♪","zh":"开心的事～♪　大家一起去找找吧～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"69021c0d512e8fabbd23b7990419c1d8d0d66225f25c5bbd1e724842dc62ca3b","ja":"（麗花さん発見。やっぱり今日も子どもたちと一緒だ。\nどこかへ行くのかな……あれ？）","zh":"（发现丽花小姐了。果然今天也和小孩子们在一起啊。\n这是要去哪儿呢……咦？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"2c5f5e8116b291ed4989a0bbbd6f4c14f4fb5e1760c8cec7375b816d485e78ac","ja":"あっ、可奈ちゃん、みーつけたっ♪\n可奈ちゃんは、かくれんぼの最中なの？","zh":"啊，可奈，找到你啦♪\n可奈现在是在玩捉迷藏吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1096.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"b82aec80d694da83b37d5a7ec5072d69178ce45b0f10341b8f4ac3120dbf10b5","ja":"い、いきなり見つかっちゃった～！？","zh":"居、居然这么快就被发现了～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
